# Rust
**/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# Node & dependencies
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Environment & secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Go build cache (not source)
# gen/go/ is intentionally committed (generated source, no protoc required to build)

# Proto: generated Rust code lives in core-engine-proto/target/ (already covered above)
# The .proto source and build.rs are committed; Rust gen happens at cargo build time.
